    <text name="support_gravity_law" data="G=G_CAD; G2+=(Yg(qCAD)*g_five_j2_gravity_delta.ravel())[J2]; G3=g_five_j3_gravity_scale*G_CAD3+g_five_j3_gravity_cosine_nm*cos(qCAD3-radians(cad_offsets_deg[J3])); clip each axis at g_five_mit_hw[:,5]. Yg is the nominal full-chain gravity potential basis (mass,hx,hy,hz per link), with world gravity=(0,0,-9.81) / base-frame gravity=(0,9.81,0). Effective residuals do not change physical masses, M(q), or c(q,v). Reference implementation: tools/five_gravity_residual_report.py:support_gravity." />
    <text name="total_friction_law" data="s=clip(abs(v_reference),.08,.8); logA=c0+c1*log(s/.08)+c2*max(0,log(s/.16))+c3*max(0,log(s/.48)); J2 adds g_five_speed_friction_j2[0]*nominal_bending_Nm + g_five_speed_friction_j2[1]*abs(G_CAD2); F=exp(logA)*tanh(v_reference/.02). nominal_bending_Nm=norm((I-aa^T)*subtree_gravity_moment) at J2. Total F replaces, not adds to, previous friction fits. Application: moving cruise axis; partial filtered measured-speed J1/J2 drag. KEY hold, pure G, held axes and ordinary Move do not add F. NOT applied by this XML. Do not sum with noload B as a second identified total loss. Reference implementation: Mode/five_mit.c:FiveMIT_SpeedFrictionTorque." />
    <text name="simulation_scope" data="{&quot;executed&quot;:[&quot;CAD mass/COM/inertia&quot;,&quot;unloaded N^2 armature and reference-only viscous B&quot;,&quot;current recorded ranges mapped to CAD radians&quot;,&quot;encoded simulation-only candidate PD&quot;,&quot;catalog peak actuator saturation&quot;,&quot;fixed FF stored in saved-pose keyframe&quot;,&quot;Native SDF robot self-contact and floor contact&quot;],&quot;data_only&quot;:[&quot;full current G/F coefficients and formulas&quot;,&quot;speed PI/active gains&quot;,&quot;KEY predicted budgets and drag parameters&quot;,&quot;unloaded electrical R/L/flux/settings&quot;],&quot;not_identified&quot;:[&quot;static friction thresholds&quot;,&quot;backlash&quot;,&quot;compliance&quot;,&quot;closed-loop electrical/thermal behavior&quot;,&quot;full-body reidentified M/c&quot;],&quot;not_implemented&quot;:[&quot;live G/F controller&quot;,&quot;MCU budget-dependent gain reduction&quot;,&quot;KEY/drag state machine&quot;,&quot;protocol enable/fault/position quantization&quot;],&quot;frictionloss_zero_means&quot;:&quot;Unidentified stiction, not measured zero mechanical friction.&quot;,&quot;collision&quot;:&quot;24 native mesh SDF volumes on six rigid bodies, including fixed hardware; all main-body pairs including neighbors enabled. Fixed hardware versus adjacent joint assemblies is filtered; nonadjacent hardware remains checked. Finite SDF search/resolution and soft contacts can miss thin intersections; not exact CAD, continuous collision detection or real-hardware protection.&quot;,&quot;initialization&quot;:&quot;GUI: pause, select keyframe 0 and Load key. FF is evaluated only at the saved pose.&quot;,&quot;assets&quot;:&quot;Uses existing absolute local mesh paths. XML is not a mesh bundle.&quot;}" />
